# Vendored Nimbus change: feat(fabric) isolate resident code boots with explicit env.
# Nimbus feat/resident-bindings 77dd793edaa1ca8fb41fabe87e2581265a8fbbfa layered over the
# committed composition patch below. ResidentCodeSpec gains optional env, globalOutbound,
# limits and capabilities; an explicit env skips the SUPERVISOR injection. npm publish is
# not authenticated on this machine, so this patch carries the change until the owner
# releases it and the patch can drop.
